# Swamp of Sorrows - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns and formulas whose SOURCE is physically in the Swamp
# of Sorrows, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Two patterns are vendor-sold by the neutral
# vendor Masat T'andr in the north; five more drop each from in-zone mobs
# (three sole-droppers found nowhere else in the data, one five-mob in-zone
# family, one above-band sole dropper noted honestly as come-back-later).
# In-zone recipes sold only by Horde-faction vendors are excluded (Alterac
# precedent - see docs/swamp-of-sorrows-companions-inventory.md), every other
# Swamp-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest records
# carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught
# staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step
# is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Tailoring,
# Engineering, Alchemy and Fishing have no Swamp source, so that is stated, not
# padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/swamp-of-sorrows-recipes
title Swamp of Sorrows - Recipes & Patterns
levels 30-38
zone Swamp of Sorrows
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords swamp of sorrows, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Stagal Bog - Masat T'andr's stock (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Masat T'andr (26.46, 31.47) in the north sells both patterns; he is the sole vendor for each anywhere in the data.
  buy 15726 "Pattern: Green Dragonscale Breastplate"
  buy 228309 "Pattern: Living Green Dragonscale Breastplate"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data.

step Fallow Sanctuary - the Cook's recipe (Cooking)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 60.93,24.28
  goto 61.82,21.85
  goto 62.39,20.9
  goto 62.5,23.31
  goto 63.98,22.8
  goto 65.23,22.8
  kill 1106 optional
  collect 250186 "Recipe: Giant Scrambled Eggs" optional
  note The Lost One Cook (level 37) in the Fallow Sanctuary is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

