step Western swamp - the herbalism formula (Enchanting)

  zone map 1435

  when skill Enchanting 1

  loop
  goto 11.43,38.66
  goto 13,37.04
  goto 14.37,34.71
  goto 14.92,38.73
  goto 15.77,40.78
  goto 15.81,36.55
  goto 16.87,38.78
  goto 46.88,37.1
  goto 49.28,35.27
  goto 51.17,36.76
  goto 54.74,32.1
  kill 764 optional
  collect 11205 "Formula: Enchant Gloves - Advanced Herbalism" optional
  note The Swampwalker (level 38) in the west is one of five in-zone droppers - the others are the Swampwalker Elder, Tangled Horror, Mire Lord, and the rare Molt Thorn. All five spawn only in the Swamp.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

